cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FRP Trace Observatory, please cite the software using these metadata."
title: "FRP Trace Observatory"
abstract: >-
  FRP Trace Observatory audits published Fractal Resonance Processor artifacts
  and reconstructs cell timelines from recorded ternary states and route
  markers. Version 1.1.0 adds support for the M32 schema, trace bundle,
  manifest and qualification report. Trace Explorer selects records by
  scheduler mode and source tick. The Ternary Transition Visualizer shows
  how a cell retains its pending target at active zero and completes the
  transition to the opposite polarity. The M26 qualification passed all
  691 tests without skips. Across the two published eight-cell traces,
  238 of 264 cell observations recorded active zero.
